      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "V addition will modify grain boundaries in a manner that facilitates ambient-temperature dislocation motion.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "V substitution will modify the local electronic and atomic structure of the BCC matrix.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The local structural changes caused by V will facilitate dislocation nucleation and motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Facilitated dislocation nucleation and motion will lower the brittle-to-ductile transition temperature.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "V-containing refractory HEAs exhibit similar mobilities or diffusivities for vacancies and interstitials.",
